75: /// many members, so the product is exponential in part count — an attacker-
76: /// or generator-controlled type with enough parts/members would otherwise
77: /// allocate unboundedly before ever returning. Same shape of guard as
78: /// `extractor/mod.rs`'s `MAX_SOURCE_NESTING_DEPTH`, applied to a different
79: /// input-derived size.
80: const MAX_TEMPLATE_LITERAL_EXPANSIONS: usize = 4096;

